    role: b("It is an important large-seed disperser in Southeast Asian rainforest. By swallowing fruit and moving between trees, it helps regenerate forest plants that smaller birds may be unable to transport.", "它是东南亚雨林重要的大种子传播者。通过吞食果实并在树木之间移动，它帮助更新小型鸟类难以搬运种子的森林植物。"),
    threats: b("The species is Critically Endangered and declining. Poachers kill birds for the solid casque, sold as 'hornbill ivory', while logging removes feeding trees and scarce nest cavities.", "该物种极危且持续下降。盗猎者为获取被称作“犀鸟象牙”的实心盔突而猎杀它们，伐木又移除食物树和稀缺巢洞。"),
    actions: b("Stop poaching and trafficking, protect safe breeding forests, retain old cavity trees, monitor nests and trade routes, and support Indigenous and local community guardians across every range country.", "应打击盗猎和走私，保护安全繁殖森林，保留老龄洞穴树，监测巢穴及贸易路线，并在所有分布国支持原住民和当地社区守护者。"),
    identify: b("A huge dark hornbill with a long red-and-yellow bill, a high solid casque, bare colored throat skin and a white tail crossed by a broad dark band; central tail feathers extend far beyond the rest.", "大型深色犀鸟，具有红黄长喙、高而实的盔突、彩色裸露喉皮；白尾有宽黑带，中央尾羽远长于其余尾羽。"),
    similar: b("Other Asian hornbills have hollower, differently shaped casques and lack the same combination of a solid red casque and very long central tail feathers. Images must show the head and tail, not just a generic hornbill silhouette.", "其他亚洲犀鸟的盔突更中空且形状不同，也缺少实心红色盔突与超长中央尾羽的组合。照片必须看清头和尾，不能只凭普通犀鸟轮廓判断。"),
    senses: b("Strong vision locates ripe fruit across the canopy. Its far-carrying, accelerating call is audible through dense forest and helps pairs maintain contact and defend space.", "敏锐视觉用于在树冠中寻找成熟果实；不断加速、传播很远的叫声可穿透密林，帮助配偶联络和维护空间。"),
    seasonal: b("Breeding timing follows regional fruit supply and suitable weather rather than one universal month. Nest occupancy lasts for months, making a breeding pair vulnerable when food near the cavity fails.", "繁殖时间随地区果实供应和适宜天气变化，并非统一月份。占巢持续数月，因此巢洞附近食物不足会使繁殖配偶格外脆弱。"),
    humans: b("The casque has long cultural significance, but present commercial demand drives lethal illegal trade. Observation should support protected forests and never reveal active nest locations publicly.", "盔突长期具有文化意义，但当代商业需求推动致命非法贸易。观鸟应支持受保护森林，绝不能公开活动巢穴的精确位置。"),
    field: b("Listen for a loud accelerating series often compared with laughter, then look high above the canopy for a long-tailed silhouette. Fallen large-fruit remains and nest activity should be recorded without approaching the tree.", "先听取常被比作笑声、不断加速的响亮连续叫声，再在树冠上方寻找长尾轮廓。大型果实残渣和巢区活动应远距离记录，不应接近巢树。"),
    trivia: [
      trivia("Unlike the hollow casque of most hornbills, its casque is largely solid.", "与多数犀鸟中空的盔突不同，盔犀鸟的盔突大部分为实心。"),
      trivia("The female walls herself into a nest cavity and depends on food passed through a slit.", "雌鸟会把自己封在巢洞内，依靠雄鸟从窄缝递送食物。"),
      trivia("Its solid casque has made it a target of the illegal carving trade.", "实心盔突使它成为非法雕刻贸易的猎杀对象。", ["conservation"]),
    ],
    classModule: classSection("Cavity nesting", "树洞繁殖", "The sealed nest protects eggs and chicks, but it also concentrates risk: loss of the male, the nest tree or nearby fruit can cause the entire breeding attempt to fail.", "封闭巢洞保护卵和幼鸟，却也集中风险：若雄鸟、巢树或附近果源丧失，整次繁殖都可能失败。"),
