    anatomy: b("Shell length can reach about 137 cm and mass exceed 225 kg, although many individuals are smaller. The thick shell has 4–6 deep radial folds; the yellow-brown to olive mantle carries many bright blue-green rings.", "壳长可达约137厘米，重量可超过225千克，但许多个体更小。厚壳具有4–6条深放射褶；黄褐至橄榄色外套膜布满亮蓝绿色环纹。"),
