    threats: b("The species is Critically Endangered and decreasing. Decades of intense harvest for meat and shells have caused very low abundance and local extinction; reef degradation and low adult density further limit recovery.", "该物种极危且持续下降。数十年为肉和贝壳进行的强烈采捕导致极低丰度及局部灭绝；礁区退化和成体密度过低又进一步限制恢复。"),
    actions: b("Enforce harvest and trade controls, protect remnant spawning groups, restore reef habitat, use genetically managed hatchery propagation where appropriate and monitor whether reintroduced clams survive and reproduce.", "应执行采捕与贸易管制，保护残存繁殖群，恢复礁区生境，在适当地区进行遗传管理的人工繁育，并监测放归个体能否存活和繁殖。"),
