    senses: b("Numerous light-sensitive organs in the mantle detect sudden shadows, causing rapid withdrawal and shell closure. Waterflow and chemical cues also affect filtration and spawning.", "外套膜中大量感光器官可发现突然阴影，触发快速收缩和闭壳；水流及化学线索也影响过滤和排放配子。"),
    seasonal: b("Spawning timing varies among reef regions and is coordinated by environmental and chemical cues. Recovery requires enough mature adults to release gametes into the same water mass at the same time.", "产卵时间随礁区而变，并由环境和化学线索协调。恢复需要足够成熟成体在同一水团、同一时间释放配子。"),
    humans: b("Giant clams are culturally and nutritionally important across the Pacific, but wild harvest has been unsustainable in many places. Legal mariculture and community-managed sanctuaries can reduce pressure only when traceable and monitored.", "砗磲在太平洋地区具有文化和营养价值，但许多地方的野采不可持续。合法养殖和社区保护区只有在可追溯并持续监测时，才能降低野外压力。"),
    field: b("Divers should photograph the whole shell, mantle, siphons and attachment area without touching or forcing closure. Record shell length, depth and reef location, and distinguish restored or cultured sites from natural populations.", "潜水调查应在不触摸、不迫使闭壳的情况下拍摄完整贝壳、外套膜、水管及附着区，记录壳长、水深和礁区，并区分放归、养殖与天然种群。"),
