    summary: b("The Yeti Crab is a pale, nearly eyeless squat lobster discovered at hydrothermal vents on the Pacific-Antarctic Ridge. Long silky setae cover its claws and arms, inspiring its name and defining a new family, Kiwaidae.", "雪人蟹是发现于太平洋—南极洋中脊热液喷口的浅色、近乎无眼铠甲虾。螯和步足覆盖丝状刚毛，因此得名，并成为新科基瓦科的代表。"),
    anatomy: b("The collected adult was about 15 cm long. The body is pale, eyes are strongly reduced and lack pigment, and the chelipeds and walking legs carry dense flexible setae that host filamentous bacteria.", "采集成体体长约15厘米。身体浅色，眼强烈退化且无色素；螯足和步足密布柔性刚毛，其上附着丝状细菌。"),
    ecology: b("Animals were observed around 2200 m deep on recent lava and near warm vent seepage. They hide around rocks and hold their setose appendages in vent-influenced water; diet and the exact importance of associated bacteria remain incompletely resolved.", "个体在约2200米深的新生熔岩和温暖喷口渗流附近被观察到。它们藏在岩石周围，并把多毛附肢伸入受喷口影响的水中；食性及附着细菌的确切作用仍未完全解决。"),
    rangeText: b("Confirmed from hydrothermal vent sites on the Pacific-Antarctic Ridge south of Easter Island. Because the habitat consists of tiny separated vent fields rather than a continuous area, the map uses a representative point.", "确认分布于复活节岛以南太平洋—南极洋中脊的热液喷口点。由于生境是彼此分隔的微小喷口场，而非连续区域，地图使用代表点。"),
